      <FB Name="LinearAxis" Type="capping::EQ_LinearAxis" x="1700" y="150" Comment="Equipment LinearAxis: Lift of the crimping head, a stepper motor through a step and direction driver, with a limit switch at the top (home). The only block that touches its pins (AtHome = gpio[0:23:pull_up], Enable = gpio[0:17:active_low], Down = gpio[0:27:active_low], Step = pwm[0:2:500000:/hostsys/class/pwm]). Skills send it what to switch on loc[Capping/LinearAxis/cmd]; it reports its inputs on loc[Capping/LinearAxis/state] and at /Objects/Capping/Equipment/LinearAxis.">
        <Parameter Name="Module" Value="&quot;Capping&quot;" />
        <Parameter Name="UaRoot" Value="&quot;/Objects/Capping&quot;" />
        <Parameter Name="UaEnable" Value="TRUE" />
        <Parameter Name="AtHome_Address" Value="'gpio[0:23:pull_up]'" />
        <Parameter Name="Enable_Address" Value="'gpio[0:17:active_low]'" />
        <Parameter Name="Down_Address" Value="'gpio[0:27:active_low]'" />
        <Parameter Name="Step_Address" Value="'pwm[0:2:500000:/hostsys/class/pwm]'" />
        <Attribute Name="GroupName" Type="STRING" Value="EquipmentIO" />
      </FB>
      <FB Name="Crimper" Type="capping::EQ_Crimper" x="4395" y="150" Comment="Equipment Crimper: Crimping head that closes around the cap; simulated until it is chosen (no pin on the Pi yet). The only block that touches its pins (Close = sim). Skills send it what to switch on loc[Capping/Crimper/cmd]; it reports its inputs on loc[Capping/Crimper/state] and at /Objects/Capping/Equipment/Crimper.">
        <Parameter Name="Module" Value="&quot;Capping&quot;" />
        <Parameter Name="UaRoot" Value="&quot;/Objects/Capping&quot;" />
        <Parameter Name="UaEnable" Value="TRUE" />
